     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>Dear all, <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>We have some problem to install the tRophicPosition package on my\r\n      computer (Windows 10).<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>We would like to know which R version for Windows is used to run\r\n      the tRophicPosition package ? <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>We have seen that the version 3.6.0 is available in April.... but\r\n      can we used another version ? <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>Thank you for your help and for this interesting work,  <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>Best regards, <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>Guillaume Marchessaux &amp; Mélanie Ourgaud <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div>-- <br>\r\n      \r\n      <div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          \r\n          \r\n          <div><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/dFuq7ml6f7XOxuK3Kc4yNeihf0EqTMfLzylWY6Wa6JU2-nc6yCRgFEtD6wXBsrIChkYbY5VMUEVEeRaC58j4NBvHfSo=s0-d-e1-ft#https://sesame.univ-amu.fr/Logos/logo_pytheas.jpg\" align=\"left\" hspace=\"0\" height=\"118\" width=\"368\">\r\n            <div>\r\n              <div>\r\n                <div><span style=\"color:#22bbea;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana;font-weight:700\">Guillaume\r\n                    <em>Marchessaux </em></span><span style=\"color:#22bbea;font-size:11px;font-family:verdana\"><em>- MIO\r\n                      INSTITUT MEDITERRANEEN D&#39;OCEANOLOGIE (FRANCE)</em></span>\r\n                  <div style=\"line-height:22px\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:11px;font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"color:#22bbea;font-size:11px;font-family:verdana\"><em>Attaché\r\n                          Temporaire d&#39;Enseignement et de Recherche\r\n                          (ATER)<br>\r\n                        </em></span>Aix-Marseille Université - </span>\r\n                    <span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:11px;font-family:verdana\">BATIMENT\r\n                      OCEANOMED - Campus Luminy - 13288 Marseille</span></